<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - APPLIED MATERIALS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - APPLIED MATERIALS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it raised its earnings estimates on Applied Materials Inc to $2.70 a share from $2.51 a share for 1997.</p>
<p>-- raised the 1998 estimate to $4.23 a share from $3.64 a share.</p>
<p>-- Applied Material, the biggest manufacturing of chip making equipment, posted third quarter profit from operations of $0.77 a share, beating analysts' estimates of $0.68 a share.</p>
<p>-- Applied Materials gained 7-5/8 to 97-7/8.</p>
</text>
